          "heading": "Everything your dealership needs, charged by AI",
          "intro": "<strong>Buzznerd is an AI platform for truck, trailer, and equipment dealerships.</strong> Built for every kind of dealership — from franchise and independent stores to commercial, fleet, and truck operations — we replace the patchwork of vendors with one connected platform so your site, inventory, and buyers all speak the same language.",
